<title>USA: Apple South Inc Q2 net income higher.</title>
<headline>Apple South Inc Q2 net income higher.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, Ga. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apple South Inc</p>
<p>		     (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p> THREE MONTHS ENDED		    JUN 29, 1997  JUN 30, 1996</p>
<p> Sales					   $202,889	 136,945</p>
<p> Net earnings				    10,224	   9,777</p>
<p> Primary EPS					  .27	     .25</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs - Primary		     38,374	  39,746</p>
<p> Fully diluted EPS				  .25	     .25</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs - fully diluted	     46,208	  39,746</p>
<p> SIX MONTHS ENDED			Jun 29, 1997  Jun 30, 1996</p>
<p> Sales					   $374,342	 263,278</p>
<p> Net earnings				    17,492	   4,290</p>
<p> Primary EPS					  .46	    .11*</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs - primary		     38,436	  39,754</p>
<p> Fully diluted EPS				  .44	    .11*</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs				   43,061	  39,754</p>
<p>NOTE: Six months 1996 earnings per share both primary and fully diluted were $0.43 before an after-tax charge for asset revaluations of $12.7 million, or $.32 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
